# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Content: whitelist. Only our own assets and Epic template content
# go to git. Third-party packs (GalleryPack, UnrealBucket, Fab,
# CityPark, FAB_Assets, Imported_Assets, ...) are excluded because
# of their size and licenses; see README.md.
# To add a new folder of your own, add a "!Content/<Folder>/" line.
